{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1812","id":4179497833,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p875HhNp","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1812","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1812.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1812.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1812","number":1812,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Produce P6-05 hypothesis tests semantic shard","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1803\n\n## What changed\n\nProduces the visually reviewed P6-05 `9709.p6.hypothesis_tests` semantic shard and promotes the cumulative Paper 6 release to five active Families.\n\n- authenticates the immutable P6-04 predecessor chain before replacement of the active projection and manifest\n- records direct complete-chain QP/MS review for all 82 primary questions (280 original image-path occurrences, 256 raw image identities)\n- emits 164 new QuestionParts: 117 approved and 47 abstained\n- represents hypothesis/tail selection, exact discrete tests, normal sampling-distribution tests, critical regions/achieved significance, Type I/II analysis, and test assumptions as distinct reusable procedures\n- reuses nine P5/P6 distribution procedures without cloning (119 reused instances)\n- preserves predecessor candidates and all previously owned QuestionParts fail-closed\n- retains one legitimate MS alternative as two branch-scoped, contiguous routes: exact binomial and continuity-corrected normal approximation\n- materializes `p6-cumulative-v5` with all 920 structural QuestionParts conserved across approved, candidate, rejected, and abstain boundaries\n\n## Why\n\nThe active P6 release previously ended at P6-04 and had no reviewed Hypothesis tests Family authority. This adds the final Family required before terminal reconciliation while preserving historical bytes and enforcing the semantic distinctions that prevent a correct number from being approved with the wrong tail, boundary, parameter, significance decision, or contextual conclusion.\n\nThe producer is a local pure builder: it reads authenticated predecessor authority but never patches predecessor module globals or functions. The focused suite fingerprints predecessor globals, function identities, and raw bytes before and after source construction and an authenticated cache hit.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=scripts/vlm python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1803_p6_hypothesis_tests_semantic_kg.py` — deterministic rebuild PASS; authenticated cache 1 miss / 1 hit\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1803_p6_hypothesis_tests_semantic_kg.test.py` — 10 tests PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` — 31 tests PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` — 27 tests PASS\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight` — branch/workflow guards healthy; expected dirty/no-upstream warnings before commit\n- `git diff --check` and Python compilation — PASS\n\nAll P6-05 readback hard gates are zero. P6-04 receipt, ledger, delta, and readback retain their exact predecessor SHA/byte identities. Visual duration was not separately instrumented and remains reported as unknown rather than inferred.\n","created_at":"2026-07-31T16:57:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T18:02:39Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T17:57:25Z","merged_at":"2026-07-31T17:57:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"93e401f04c5195243b20e4a5dd11aa846eec6179","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1812/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1812/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1812/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/34e71c49175beb71c84225c24452d563bb8e9565","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1803-p6-05-hypothesis-tests","ref":"task/1803-p6-05-hypothesis-tests","sha":"34e71c49175beb71c84225c24452d563bb8e9565","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879